-The family becomes easy with a CAS, with the disclosed matrix solver, or once the triangular conjugacy is recognized and the modular recurrence is executed accurately.  The 0/200,000 figure estimates uniform guessing over all nonzero coordinate vectors; it does not model a solver using algebraic structure.  The attacks cover a coordinate outlier, direct-target and divide-by-two guesses, partial recognition of either the cycle or the basis change, and 256 uniform restarts per seed.  They do not include a computer-algebra finite-field inverse routine, a dedicated structured-matrix solver, or a successful oracle pool run; Gaussian elimination is the only domain-standard automated reference measured here.  `canonical_key` removes arbitrary reordering of displayed slots but does not attempt general finite-field basis isomorphism, which would overstate what can be canonicalized cheaply.
