+displayed vector v into its normal-basis coordinate vector w, first form
+chain coordinates c using c[slot_to_chain[j]]=v[j], and then use
+  w[0]=c[0],
+  w[i]=c[i]+b[i]*w[i-1] mod q  for i=1,...,e-1.
